  "brief": {
    "zh": "还记得杯子上的电量名牌吗？这次在调试器里找 charge，给它读到的电量加 3，再试试把结果存到哪个名字下。",
    "en": "Remember the name tag on the charge cup? Find charge in the debugger, add 3 to its reading, and try choosing where to save the result."
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "读取、计算与赋值",
    "en": "Reading, calculating, and assigning values"
  },
  "hints": [],
  "execution": {
    "source": "charge = scan()\nresult = charge + 3\nsay(str(result))",
    "assignment": {
      "overwriteSource": "charge = scan()\ncharge = charge + 3\nsay(str(charge))",
      "inputVariable": "charge",
      "resultVariable": "result"
    },
    "cases": [
      {
        "label": {
          "zh": "起始电量 6 格",
          "en": "Start with 6 units"
        },
        "input": 6,
        "expected": "9"
      },
      {
        "label": {
          "zh": "起始电量 1 格",
          "en": "Start with 1 unit"
        },
        "input": 1,
        "expected": "4",
        "predictions": [
          "1",
          "4",
          "9"
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": {
          "zh": "起始电量 0 格",
          "en": "Start with 0 units"
        },
        "input": 0,
        "expected": "3",
        "predictions": [
          "0",
          "9",
          "3"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "用变量记住原电量",
        "en": "Remember the starting charge in a variable"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "读取电量后，把数字放进名叫 charge 的格子。后面用到 charge 时，程序就从这个格子里取数。",
        "en": "After reading the charge, store the number in a box called charge. When the program uses charge later, it reads the number in that box."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "先算右边，再写左边",
        "en": "Calculate the right side before storing on the left"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "charge = charge + 3 先取出 charge 中的 6，算出 9，再把 9 写回 charge。写回之前，格子里还是 6。",
        "en": "In charge = charge + 3, the program reads the old 6, calculates 9, then writes 9 back into charge. The box still holds 6 while the right side is being calculated."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "左边的名字决定结果放在哪",
        "en": "The name on the left decides where the result goes"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "result = charge + 3 把 9 存进 result，charge 依然是 6。两种写法都算出 9，可以通过变量里的值看出区别。",
        "en": "With result = charge + 3, the program puts 9 into result, leaving 6 in charge. Both instructions calculate 9. The boxes show where it is stored."
      }
    }
  ],
  "question": {
    "prompt": {
      "zh": "charge 一开始是 6。执行 charge = charge + 3 后，charge 的值是多少？",
      "en": "charge starts at 6. What is in charge after running charge = charge + 3?"
    },
    "options": [
      {
        "zh": "6",
        "en": "6"
      },
      {
        "zh": "9",
        "en": "9"
      },
      {
        "zh": "3",
        "en": "3"
      }
    ],
    "correct": 1,
    "feedback": {
      "zh": "先读出 6，加 3 得到 9，再用 9 更新 charge。",
      "en": "First read 6 and add 3. Then store the resulting 9 in charge."
    }
  },
